      "id": "claim_cc748348359d4344ba64ed786b3366ff",
      "statement": "失败分类规则是固定映射：401 → `auth-failure`；403 且 `x-ratelimit-remaining: 0` → `rate-limited`，403 其他 → `auth-failure`；422 → `invalid-request`；其他状态 → `http-failure`；`fetch` 抛出（含超时）→ `network-failure`，以上由 `tests/github.spec.ts` 的假 transport 断言覆盖。",
      "evidence": [
        {
